    %% Notes
    note1["Note: All database operations must be routed through TenantRoutingDataSource to ensure tenant isolation"]
    note2["Note: Tenant context must be established before any database operation and cleaned up after request completion"]
    note3["Note: Sample data initialization occurs on every application startup, clearing previous data"]
    note4["Note: Database migrations must complete successfully before application serves requests"]
    note5["Note: Email addresses must be unique within each tenant"]
    note6["Note: Posts must be associated with a valid author and cannot exist independently"]
    note7["Note: Cascade delete removes all posts when an author is deleted"]
    note8["Note: All timestamps are stored and processed in GMT timezone"]
    note9["Note: ThreadLocal storage must be cleaned up after request completion to prevent memory leaks"]
    note10["Note: API responses must include appropriate HTTP status codes and error details"]
    note11["Note: Each tenant must have a unique datasource configuration with separate database credentials"]
    note12["Note: Connection pooling must be configured per tenant to optimize resource usage"]
    note13["Note: X-tenant header is required for all API requests to identify the tenant"]
    note14["Note: Only the post owner can update or delete their own posts"]
    note15["Note: Post dates are automatically set to current date and cannot be manually specified"]

    note1 -.->|constraint| ucrouteconnection
